  "name": "DIFFUSE LARGE B CELL LYMPHOMA PANEL",
  "code": "1414",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1406\">\n<p data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1153\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">This panel helps in:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1406\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1250\">\n<p data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1250\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1188\">Classifying DLBCL subtypes</strong> (Germinal Center B-cell [GCB] vs Activated B-cell [ABC] type)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1309\">\n<p data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1309\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1274\">Prognostication</strong> and identifying high-risk patients</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1406\">\n<p data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1406\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1338\">Therapeutic guidance</strong> (e.g., need for intensified regimens in double expressor lymphomas)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1456\">\n<p data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1456\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1418\">CD20</strong> positivity confirms B-cell lineage.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1533\">\n<p data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1533\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1483\">CD10, BCL6, and MUM1</strong> are used for <strong data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1530\">cell of origin classification</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1596\">\n<p data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1596\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1550\">High Ki-67</strong> indicates increased proliferative activity.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1675\">\n<p data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1675\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1626\">MYC and BCL2 positivity</strong> (Double expressor) suggests aggressive behavior.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
